---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

---

<BaseLayout title="Beyond Work - Nivedita Pandey" description="Beyond professional work - Vedic texts, adventure sports, travel across 16+ countries, performing arts, writing, and animal rescue.">
  <div class="beyond-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Beyond Work</h1>
      <p class="page-description">
        Outside of professional work, I have several deep interests that shape how I think and live.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="beyond-grid">

      <div class="beyond-item">
        <h2>Spirituality</h2>
        <p>
          I maintain a serious engagement with Vedic texts, the Ramcharitmanas, and meditation practices. These aren't
          casual interests - they're frameworks I use to understand purpose, time, and uncertainty.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-item">
        <h2>Animals & Rescue</h2>
        <p>
          I have a profound connection with animals, particularly cats. I support animal rescue work and believe in the
          responsibility we have toward creatures who cannot advocate for themselves.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-item">
        <h2>Adventure Sports</h2>
        <div class="section-banner">
          <img
            src="/images/beyond-adventure.png"
            alt="Rappelling"
            class="section-banner-img"
            />
        </div>
        <p>
          Skydiving, PADI-certified diving, ziplining, rappelling - deliberately chosen because they scared me.
          I've always believed that growth lives on the other side of fear, and that the only way to find out
          what you're capable of is to put yourself somewhere you can't fake it. The clarity that comes from
          committing to something that frightens you - the focus, the risk calibration, the ability to stay
          grounded when the stakes are real - that's the same mental discipline I bring to high-stakes decisions
          at work. You don't learn that in a boardroom.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-item">
        <h2>Travel & Languages</h2>
        <p>
          Travelled to 16+ countries across Asia, Europe, and the Americas. Living and working across four countries
          has made me fluent in reading context - how systems, cultures, and institutions operate differently
          depending on where you are. Travel is less about tourism and more about pattern recognition.
        </p>
        <p>
          I speak English and Hindi, and have learnt both French and Sanskrit - two languages as different from
          each other as they could be, and both endlessly rewarding.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-item">
        <h2>Writing</h2>
        <p>
          I also write about society, culture, and the questions that make people uncomfortable.
          You can find that work at <a href="https://mindunruled.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Uncomfortable Enquiry →</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beyond-item">
        <h2>Performing Arts</h2>
        <p>
          I've been learning piano for the past couple of years, and I've sung for most of my life - both casually, without a performance goal attached. There's something about learning an instrument as an adult that's clarifying in a way that's hard to explain. Guitar is next. I occasionally share these on Instagram - unpolished and in progress, which is exactly the point.
        </p>

        <h3 class="reel-heading">Recent practice</h3>
        <div class="reel-grid">
          <div class="reel-item">
            <span class="reel-label">"The Gael" (Last of the Mohicans) - Month 1</span>
            <div class="reel-embed">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.instagram.com/tv/CRDxyn2HD-G/embed"
                title="Learning The Gael - Month 1"
                loading="lazy"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reel-item">
            <span class="reel-label">"The Gael" (Last of the Mohicans) - Month 2</span>
            <div class="reel-embed">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.instagram.com/tv/CTcFVOpgsef/embed"
                title="Learning The Gael - Month 2"
                loading="lazy"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reel-item">
            <span class="reel-label">"The Gael" (Last of the Mohicans) - Month 3</span>
            <div class="reel-embed">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DBqq6kYSqZI/embed"
                title="Learning The Gael - Month 3"
                loading="lazy"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="reel-item">
            <span class="reel-label">"The Gramophone Waltz" - Eugen Doga</span>
            <div class="reel-embed">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.instagram.com/reel/DB05fGGyfcm/embed"
                title="The Gramophone Waltz - Eugen Doga"
                loading="lazy"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .beyond-page {
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .page-description {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .beyond-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .beyond-item {
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .beyond-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .beyond-item h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .beyond-item p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .beyond-item p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .section-banner {
    width: 100%;
    height: 380px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .section-banner-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
    display: block;
  }

  .reel-heading {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .reel-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .reel-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .reel-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .reel-embed {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--sidebar-bg);
  }

  .reel-embed iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .section-banner {
      height: 200px;
    }

    .reel-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
